Package: erhai-mesa
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Erwin <yzddmr7@gmail.com>
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Depends: @DEPENDS@, libvulkan1
Description: Freedreno desktop and Turnip Vulkan drivers for the OnePlus Pad 2 Pro
 Private Mesa libraries with the upstream Adreno 830v1 device entry.
 GNOME and systemd user sessions select this driver at their next start
 while the GPU is bound to its kernel driver, and Ubuntu's software renderer
 otherwise; distribution libraries remain owned and updated by Ubuntu.
 Includes desktop OpenGL and GLES and the Turnip Vulkan driver, whose loader
 manifest replaces Ubuntu's Turnip manifest by diversion. Removing this
 package restores distribution driver selection at the next session start.
